abstract: "Code, the assembled stream-month panel, the replication-level results of the simulation studies, the results of the case study and the figure scripts for the manuscript 'A common-cause frailty model and importance decomposition for supply-system reliability'. Raw UN Comtrade records are not redistributed; the extraction script retrieves them from the public API."
